Conflicts: oc-board-config-host
Replaces: oc-board-config-host, afc
Breaks: afc (<< ${afc:Version})
Description: BTT CB2 host integration for OC board Klipper configuration
 Device paths, optional Canvas integration, and the manual USB recovery
 helper for the BigTreeTech CB2. Only one host configuration may be installed.
